# EOA Controller Component

Externally Owned Account (EOA) controller implementation that monitors Ethereum addresses for balance tracking in 0xSplits groups.

## Key Integration Pattern
Periodic balance polling (12-second intervals) across healthy Ethereum nodes with concurrent metric collection.

## Important Constraints
- Balance queries must handle nil responses gracefully and continue with remaining nodes
- Metrics singleton pattern enforced - register metrics only once via GetMetricsInstance()
- Address validation required during configuration to prevent runtime failures